# Citation metadata (https://citation-file-format.github.io/). GitHub shows a
# "Cite this repository" button from this file. Bump `version` and
# `date-released` when a data release is tagged.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this data, please cite it as below and credit the upstream
  sources named in each dataset's manifest (see docs/about/license.md).
type: dataset
title: World GeoJSON
abstract: >-
  Open, versioned GeoJSON administrative boundaries with a stable feature id,
  a per-country manifest and a global index. Country outlines from Natural
  Earth; subnational levels from geoBoundaries (permissive licences only) and
  national spatial data infrastructures.
authors:
